{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>11月18日，亞太經濟合作組織（APEC）工商領導人峰會在深圳舉行，目前正進行亞太經合組織經濟體領導人特別致辭。加拿大總理卡尼、泰國總理阿努廷、澳洲總理阿爾巴尼斯、韓國總統李在明、越共中央總書記兼國家主席蘇林等APEC經濟體領導人將特別致辭。</p><figure><img alt=\"加拿大總理卡尼致辭。（香港01直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199720961113460736879451.png/fkLW5K1ZbFnVFztqYhLry5Lo720ioRUMiNNYzYjTWM0\"/><figcaption>加拿大總理卡尼致辭。（香港01直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"加拿大總理卡尼致辭。（香港01直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199720958584164352465821.png/zdPka4Nm0z7vbkvUbH9TII44eZmB1kiacl9-v3Jffr8\"/><figcaption>加拿大總理卡尼致辭。（香港01直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"泰國總理阿努廷致辭。（香港01直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199727205488398336619804.png/tsjL7OZW-t1IbQ3adhLVwFKJQTNltvR4GtKTyRrSk8k\"/><figcaption>泰國總理阿努廷致辭。（香港01直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"泰國總理阿努廷致辭。（香港01直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199727202896187392416785.png/1yjhEIR-x3q3K_aFQ3NOTklKCFZCUTkLzjKO884yjvM\"/><figcaption>泰國總理阿努廷致辭。（香港01直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澳洲總理阿爾巴尼斯致辭。（香港01直播）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199735460562341888198320.png/V6zEiyguJdtzKUjbdB0iK9s1Vw_NELOfSoTOCEqEzgg\"/><figcaption>澳洲總理阿爾巴尼斯致辭。（香港01直播）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澳洲總理阿爾巴尼斯致辭。（香港01直播）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199735457915604992483591.png/eNmHtkxJfCn7jENA9ijXPS-frqoC-eRquOUp5LjlKeQ\"/><figcaption>澳洲總理阿爾巴尼斯致辭。（香港01直播）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:07:19.110035+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":247,"images":6,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:45:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:21:11.591548+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:00:47.387561+00:00","content_hash":"dbef9742f3a7bfc3f1278f459ae0d856d66dedb6d2d22c90272c594bffceab0a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":nu